      en: ["The building was completed in 1852 during the British colonial era.", "It serves as the official residence and working office of the President of Guyana.", "The architecture blends Victorian style with adaptations for the tropical climate.", "State House is located on Carmichael Street in the capital city of Georgetown.", "It was originally designed as the residence for governors of British Guiana.", "The structure is built almost entirely from durable local hardwoods."],
