      en: ["The building was constructed between 1877 and 1882 by architect Cesar Castellani.", "It was officially inaugurated as the National Gallery of Art in 1993.", "Castellani House is located at the corner of Vlissengen Road and Homestretch Avenue.", "During the 1960s, it served as the residence of Prime Minister Forbes Burnham.", "The gallery houses the National Collection of Art, comprising over 700 works.", "It is a gazetted national monument and a prime example of colonial timber architecture."],
