      en: ["The chapel was originally founded in 1824 by missionary John Wray.", "The current structure was completed in 1841 to serve a larger congregation.", "It was officially designated as a National Monument in 2004.", "The church was instrumental in teaching literacy to emancipated people.", "It is located on Chapel Street in the town of New Amsterdam.", "The building represents the early 19th-century Congregationalist architectural style."],
